<header class="ref-head"><span class="hero-ornament"></span><h1 class="research-title">30 June in history</h1><p class="ref-lede">6 events that happened on 30 June, from 1520 to 1997.</p></header>
<ol class="day-events"><li class="tih-event-card tih-has-thumb tih-event-hero"><p class="tih-hero-kicker">&#10022; Anniversary of the day</p><a class="tih-event-thumb" href="/encyclopedia/tenochtitlan" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/tenochtitlan.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="168" height="112"></a><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year"><a href="/years/1520">1520 CE</a> <span class="tih-ago">506 years ago</span></p><h2 class="tih-event-title">Cortés flees Tenochtitlan on the Noche Triste</h2><p class="tih-event-desc">Under attack by the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/mexica">Mexica</a>, Cortés's forces fought their way out of the city along the causeways at night, losing hundreds of Spaniards and many more Tlaxcalan allies. He returned to besiege it in 1521.</p><div class="tih-tags"><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/tenochtitlan">Tenochtitlan</a><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/mexica">Mexica</a></div></div></li><li class="tih-event-card"><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year"><a href="/years/1559">1559 CE</a> <span class="tih-ago">467 years ago</span></p><h2 class="tih-event-title">Henry II of France is mortally wounded in a joust</h2><p class="tih-event-desc">A splinter from the lance of the Count of Montgomery pierced the king's eye at a tournament in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/paris">Paris</a>. His death ten days later left <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/france">France</a> to weak young sons on the eve of the Wars of Religion.</p><div class="tih-tags"><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/paris">Paris</a></div></div></li><li class="tih-event-card"><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year"><a href="/years/1905">1905 CE</a> <span class="tih-ago">121 years ago</span></p><h2 class="tih-event-title">Einstein's paper on special relativity reaches the journal</h2><p class="tih-event-desc">Annalen der Physik received 'On the Electrodynamics of Moving Bodies', which showed that measurements of time and space depend on motion. E = mc² followed in a short sequel that autumn.</p></div></li><li class="tih-event-card"><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year"><a href="/years/1908">1908 CE</a> <span class="tih-ago">118 years ago</span></p><h2 class="tih-event-title">Tunguska explosion flattens Siberian forest</h2><p class="tih-event-desc">An asteroid or comet fragment exploded above the Tunguska river, levelling some 2,000 square km of forest. It is the largest impact event in recorded history.</p></div></li><li class="tih-event-card"><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year"><a href="/years/1934">1934 CE</a> <span class="tih-ago">92 years ago</span></p><h2 class="tih-event-title">Hitler purges the SA in the Night of the Long Knives</h2><p class="tih-event-desc">SS squads killed SA chief <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ernst-rohm">Ernst Röhm</a> and other rivals, including the former chancellor Kurt von Schleicher. The army welcomed the purge, and Hitler's grip on power tightened.</p></div></li><li class="tih-event-card"><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year"><a href="/years/1997">1997 CE</a> <span class="tih-ago">29 years ago</span></p><h2 class="tih-event-title">Britain hands Hong Kong back to China</h2><p class="tih-event-desc">At midnight, at a ceremony attended by the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/prince-of-wales">Prince of Wales</a> and President <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/jiang-zemin">Jiang Zemin</a>, <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/sovereignty">sovereignty</a> passed to <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/china">China</a> after 156 years of British rule. <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/hong-kong">Hong Kong</a> became a <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/special-administrative-regions-of-china">Special Administrative Region</a>.</p><div class="tih-tags"><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/hong-kong">Hong Kong</a></div></div></li></ol>
